  "notes": [
    {
      "at": 1,
      "quote": "boolean scheduleTransaction(@NonNull ClientTransaction transaction) {",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "向客户端下发一个 ClientTransaction。这是 system_server 驱动客户端生命周期变化的唯一出口。"
    },
    {
      "at": 2,
      "quote": "final RemoteException e = transaction.schedule();",
      "kind": "call",
      "text": "**真正跨进程**：transaction.schedule() 内部走 ApplicationThread binder 调用；返回 RemoteException 表示没送到。"
    },
    {
      "at": 3,
      "quote": "if (e != null) {",
      "kind": "branch",
      "text": "投递失败。"
    },
    {
      "at": 4,
      "quote": "final WindowProcessController wpc = mWms.mAtmService.getProcessController(",
      "kind": "data",
      "text": "取进程控制器，只为了日志里能打出进程名。"
    },
    {
      "at": 5,
      "quote": "transaction.getClient());",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "续行。"
    },
    {
      "at": 6,
      "quote": "Slog.w(TAG, \"Failed to deliver transaction for \" + wpc + \"\\ntransaction=\" + this, e);",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "W 级日志：Failed to deliver transaction。**客户端进程可能已死或 binder 已断**，这是排查「Activity 卡在某状态」的关键线索。"
    },
    {
      "at": 7,
      "quote": "return false;",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "返回 false，调用方据此决定是否放弃该状态变化。"
    },
    {
      "at": 8,
      "quote": "}",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "关闭判断。"
    },
    {
      "at": 9,
      "quote": "return true;",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "投递成功。"
    },
    {
      "at": 10,
